WHAT WAS CHANGED

Each file keeps its source instance's constraint matrix, objective and
right-hand side. Changed relative to the source: variable bounds are tightened
(primal-infeasible) or relaxed (dual-infeasible), rows are deleted
(dual-infeasible only), and integrality is dropped throughout. Every instance's
`.meta.json` sidecar records exactly which changes were made.

